{"completed": true, "response": "```json\n{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1.1\",\n        \"B1.3\",\n        \"B4.1\",\n        \"B4.2\",\n        \"B4.6\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"抵触开始有了可辨认的舞步和面向众人的庄严，却不是英雄凯旋。外在的自持像整理衣装、抬起头，把悲伤收住；悲伤并未消失，只是不肯完全向它屈服。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\",\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1.2\",\n        \"B1.4\",\n        \"B2.1\",\n        \"B2.2\",\n        \"B2.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"这股力量仍没有清楚的对象：旋律像一首只能模糊哼出的旧歌，珍惜之物仿佛还在，却不能再像从前那样拥有。舞步因此带着虚浮感，庄严的节奏托着脆弱的旋律，底下的不安半音仍在蠕动。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\",\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B3.1\",\n        \"B3.2\",\n        \"B4.3\",\n        \"B4.4\",\n        \"B4.5\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"38–43小节，音乐猛地向上推进又退回来；44–65小节重新聚拢力量，却始终没有安稳落地。若把这种努力听成反复对自己说“我没事”，那么从最初尚且相信，到后来勉强让自己相信，再到连这句话都泄露出在意，正显出这股力量始终难以稳住。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B5.1\",\n        \"B5.2\",\n        \"B5.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"这一组独立保留另一侧面的读法：44–65小节的激昂可以听成不甘心就此消亡的负隅顽抗。它可以与自我控制并存，但不把两种原稿的说法拼成同一个人的确定剧情。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": [\n        \"S02-1\",\n        \"S02-2\"\n      ],\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B3.3\"\n      ],\n      \"alt\": false,\n      \"note\": \"56–65小节，连绵的三连音把呼吸催得越来越急。抵触仍在向前撑着，力量却没有因此变得安稳；直到这一段结束，那股不肯退让又无法彻底站稳的劲仍悬而未决。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"explains\": [\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-1\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"未明的抵触开始转化为不肯退让的自持，因此舞步虽已清楚、姿态虽显庄严，却并非凯旋；自我控制也正是悲伤仍在、却不肯完全向悲伤屈服的表现。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"line\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"beads\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ],\n      \"why\": \"抵触对象仍不明确，且对抗中夹着迟疑，所以旋律像模糊的记忆，庄严节奏与脆弱旋律彼此牵制，伴奏暗藏不安；音乐的推进与回撤、反复自我安慰时逐渐显露的在意，也都表现出这股力量尚难稳定。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unexplained\": [\n    {\n      \"bead\": \"B5\",\n      \"why\": \"这一组把44–65小节的激昂另行解释为不甘消亡的负隅顽抗。虽然它与S02-1所说的不肯退让存在联系，但B5.3明确提醒不要把两种原稿的说法拼成同一个人的确定剧情，因此将B5独立呈现，不纳入当前线的因果故事。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```", "metadata": {"session_handle": "c1d01eed-1b6b-47e1-8fa3-78aa5a634055", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T135136537507Z", "elapsed_seconds": 185.985, "completed_utc": "2026-10-23T13:54:42.526638+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "09d81d76999c08b26e2bfb0134682f0a258eca055c5f9263c201b0c919a15a7c", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "30cf31059194d34457cecf86ec06639767021c07b9a7cda0ca767614c0d702ad", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261023T135136537507Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], 